# Custom build: only compiles the gifbox crate (and its transitive deps),
# not the whole monorepo - upstream's Dockerfile assumes a prebuilt
# ghcr.io/stoatchat/base image with every service already compiled, which
# doesn't exist for this fork.
FROM rust:1.92.0-slim-trixie AS builder
WORKDIR /home/rust/src

RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
    make pkg-config libssl-dev libdav1d-dev

COPY Cargo.toml Cargo.lock ./
COPY crates ./crates
RUN cargo build -j "${CARGO_BUILD_JOBS:-4}" --locked --release -p revolt-gifbox

FROM gcr.io/distroless/cc-debian13:nonroot
COPY --from=builder /home/rust/src/target/release/revolt-gifbox ./

EXPOSE 14706
USER nonroot
CMD ["./revolt-gifbox"]
